    "description": "Postman tests derived from api-contracts.md.\n\nSet the collection variable baseUrl to the API origin (default: [http://localhost:8000](http://localhost:8000)).\n\nImportant: requests marked STATE-DEPENDENT require the stated server state. A full collection run may not satisfy those preconditions and may therefore produce expected failures. Run them individually or arrange the backend state first.\n\nThe contract does not define coordinate bounds, integer-only constraints, duplicate-position behavior, error response bodies, or timing thresholds; this collection does not assert those unspecified details.",
